ms_nixon_florida_261103/1/abs/index.m3u8" medium="video"><media:credit></media:credit><media:title>Democrat Angie Nixon in the lead as early Florida votes counted</media:title><media:player url="https://www.nbcnews.com/video/democrat-angie-nixon-in-the-lead-as-early-florida-votes-counted-272808517874"></media:player><media:thumbnail url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/mpx/2704722219/2026_11/1793752367540_nbc_midterms_nixon_florida_261103_S3_1920x1080-otktiy.jpg"></media:thumbnail><media:description type="plain">As vote count begins in Florida, Democrat Senate candidate Angie Nixon is in the lead against her opponent Republican Ashley Moody. </media:description><media:subTitle type="text/srt" lang="en-US" url="https://prodamdnewsencoding.akamaized.net/NBC_News_Digital/nbcnews/captions/2026/11/1793752367540_nbc_midterms_nixon_florida_261103.srt"></media:subTitle><media:subTitle type="text/vtt" lang="en-US" url="https://prodamdnewsencoding.akamaized.net/NBC_News_Digital/nbcnews/captions/2026/11/1793752367540_nbc_midterms_nixon_florida_261103.vtt"></media:subTitle></media:content><media:thumbnail url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/mpx/2704722219/2026_11/1793752367540_nbc_midterms_nixon_florida_261103_S3_1920x1080-otktiy.jpg"></media:thumbnail><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 00:32:53 GMT</pubDate><title>Democrat Angie Nixon in the lead as early Florida votes counted</title><updateDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 00:36:24 GMT</updateDate></item><item><dateTimeWritten>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 00:15:21 GMT</dateTimeWritten><description>Early voting results in Indiana show Democrat J.D. Ford holding a substantial lead over his opponent Victoria Spartz in Hamilton County. By comparison, the early point dump from the county in 2024 showed then-Vice President Kamala Harris leading by just one point. </description><expires>2056-11-03T23:14:25.000+0000</expires><guid isPermaLink="false">nbc_midterms_indiana_early_261103</guid><link>https://www.nb