ype="plain">Google headquarters in Mountain View, Calif.</media:description></media:content><media:thumbnail url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-05/260519-google-ch-1541-154f28.jpg" height="1667" width="2500"></media:thumbnail><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 18:32:31 GMT</pubDate><title>Google to shut off search for schools that opt out of AI</title><updateDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 18:32:31 GMT</updateDate></item><item><dc:creator>Lawrence Hurley</dc:creator><dateTimeWritten>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 11:00:40 GMT</dateTimeWritten><description>The justices heard arguments in the latest in a line of cases pitting religious rights against LGBTQ rights.</description><expires>2112-01-01T00:00:00.000+0000</expires><guid>https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/supreme-court/supreme-court-hears-catholic-colorado-preschool-program-case-rcna605703</guid><link>https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/supreme-court/supreme-court-hears-catholic-colorado-preschool-program-case-rcna605703</link><media:content url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-10/261027-scotus-colorado-prek-sjr-1224-da0a24.jpg" type="image/jpeg" medium="image" height="1667" width="2500"><media:credit>Stella Ragas</media:credit><media:text type="plain">Grid of photos containing the U.S. Supreme Court building, a preschool classroom, and Jesus on the cross, with colored blocks that represent the colors of the Colorado flag.</media:text><media:description type="plain">Colorado bars entities from participating in its universal preschool program if they refuse admission to children based on their or their parents’ sexual orientation or gender identity.</media:description></media:content><media:thumbnail url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-10/261027-scotus-colorado-prek-sjr-1224-da0a24.jpg" height="1667" width="2500"></media:thumbnail><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 11:00:40 GMT</pubDate><title>Supreme Court sympathetic to Catholic plea to participate in Colorado preschool program</title><updateDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 19:35:43 GMT</updateDate></item><item><dc:creator>Dennis Romero</dc:creator><dc:creator>Daniella Silva</dc:creator><dc:contributor>The Associated Press</dc:contributor><dc:contributor>Matt Lavietes</dc:contributor><dc:contributor>Joe Kottke</dc:contributor><dc:contributor>Dan Gallo</dc:contributor><dc:contributor> Emanuella Grinberg</dc:contributor><dateTimeWritten>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 18:01:40 GMT</dateTimeWritten><description>Jacob Allen Morley escaped from prison in the small town of Tiptonville and is alleged to have stolen a truck. He was convicted last year of killing a co-worker in 2022.</description><expires>2112-01-01T00:00:00.000+0000</expires><guid>https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/escaped-tennessee-inmate-jacob-morley-captured-rcna606042</guid><link>https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/escaped-tennessee-inmate-jacob-morley-captured-rcna606042</link><media:content url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-10/261027-Jacob-Allen-Morley-vsb-2247-983483.jpg" type="image/jpeg" medium="image" height="1667" width="2500"><media:credit></media:credit><media:text type="plain">Jacob Allen Morley.</media:text><media:description type="plain">Security video of escaped inmate Jacob Allen Morley.</media:description></media:content><media:content url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-10/261027-Jacob-Morley-vsb-2301-fae1e6.jpg" type="image/jpeg" medium="image" height="450" width="338"><media:credit>Tennessee Department of Corrections</media:credit><media:text type="plain">Jacob Morley.</media:text><media:description type="plain">Security video of escaped inmate Jacob Allen Morley.</media:description></media:content><media:thumbnail url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-10/261027-Jacob-Allen-Morley-vsb-2247-983483.jpg" height="1667" width="2500"></media:thumbnail><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 18:01:40 GMT</pubDate><title>Escaped Tennessee inmate captured, authorities say</title><updateDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 19:26:26 GMT</updateDate></item><item><dc:creator>Matt Dixon</dc:creator><dateTimeWritten>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 00:31:05 GMT</dateTimeWritten><description>Democratic Sen. Jon Ossoff has won re-election against Republican Rep. Mike Collins, NBC News projects, prevailing in Georgia after a nationally watched race that was defined, at times, by heated personal attacks. </description><expires>2112-01-01T00:00:00.000+0000</expires><guid>https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/2026-election/jon-ossoff-wins-georgia-senate-election-midterms-mike-collins-rcna603336</guid><link>https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/2026-election/jon-ossoff-wins-georgia-senate-election-midterms-mike-collins-rcna603336</link><media:content url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-10/261021-jon-ossoff-georgia-senate-midterms-vsb-2205-2fdffd.jpg" type="image/jpeg" medium="image" height="1667" width="2500"><media:credit>Elijah Nouvelage</media:credit><media:text type="plain">U.S. Senator Jon Ossoff.</media:text><media:description type="plain">Sen. Jon Ossoff during a campaign event in Marietta, Ga., in October.</media:description></media:content><media:content url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-10/261021-mike-collins-georgia-senator-midterms-vsb-2216-9f617b.jpg" type="image/jpeg" medium="image" height="1666" width="2500"><media:credit>Kevin Dietsch</media:credit><media:text type="plain">U.S. Rep. Mike Collins.</media:text><media:description type="plain">Sen. Jon Ossoff during a campaign event in Marietta, Ga., in October.</media:description></media:content><media:thumbnail url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-10/261021-jon-ossoff-georgia-senate-midterms-vsb-2205-2fdffd.jpg" height="1667" width="2500"></media:thumbnail><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 00:31:05 GMT</pubDate><title>Democratic Sen. Jon Ossoff cruises to re-election in Georgia</title><updateDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 00:31:05 GMT</updateDate></item><item><dc:creator>Stephanie Perry, NBC News Exit Poll Desk </dc:creator><dc:creator>Jon Schuppe</dc:creator><dc:contributor>Patrick J. Egan, NBC News Exit Poll Desk</dc:contributor><dc:contributor>Hannah Hartig, NBC News Exit Poll Desk</dc:contributor><dc:contributor>Courtney Kennedy, NBC News Exit Poll Desk</dc:contributor><dc:contributor>Maureen Michaels, NBC News Exit Poll Desk</dc:contributor><dc:contributor>Mara Ostfeld, NBC News Exit Poll Desk</dc:contributor><dateTimeWritten>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 22:06:52 GMT</dateTimeWritten><description>The president’s approval rating dropped among voters, who have big concerns about the economy, according to early polling results. </description><expires>2112-01-01T00:00:00.000+0000</expires><guid>https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/2026-election/exit-poll-trump-midterms-voters-economy-disapproval-rcna607045</guid><link>https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/2026-election/exit-poll-trump-midterms-voters-economy-disapproval-rcna607045</link><media:content url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-11/261103-las-vegas-voting-mn-1130-d7c564.jpg" type="image/jpeg" medium="image" height="4000" width="6000"><media:credit>John Locher</media:credit><media:text type="plain">Voters line up outside a polling station near Allegiant Stadium, home of the Las Vegas Raiders, Tuesday, Nov. 3, 2026, in Las Vegas. </media:text><media:description type="plain">Voters line up outside a polling station near Allegiant Stadium, home of the Las Vegas Raiders, Tuesday, Nov. 3, 2026, in Las Vegas. </media:description></media:content><media:thumbnail url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-11/261103-las-vegas-voting-mn-1130-d7c564.jpg" height="4000" width="6000"></media:thumbnail><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 22:06:52 GMT</pubDate><title>Exit poll: Voters cast ballots against Trump</title><updateDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 23:51:36 GMT</updateDate></item><item><dc:creator>The Politics Desk</dc:creator><dateTimeWritten>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 21:30:00 GMT</dateTimeWritten><description>Welcome to a special Election Day edition of the From the Politics Desk newsletter, where we’re putting all the links and information you’ll need when the vote tallies start rolling in tonight in one place.</description><expires>2112-01-01T00:00:00.000+0000</expires><guid>https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/politics-news/everything-need-election-night-politics-desk-rcna607298</guid><link>https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/politics-news/everything-need-election-night-politics-desk-rcna607298</link><media:content url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-11/261103-Voters-aa-258-992778.jpg" type="image/jpeg" medium="image" height="1467" width="2200"><media:credit>Angelina Katsanis</media:credit><media:text type="plain">New York Residents Cast Ballots With Control Of House, Senate At Stake</media:text><media:description type="plain">Voters cast their ballots at a polling location in the Harlem neighborhood of New York, US, on Tuesday, Nov. 3, 2026.</media:description></media:content><media:thumbnail url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-11/261103-Voters-aa-258-992778.jpg" height="1467" width="2200"></media:thumbnail><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 21:30:00 GMT</pubDate><title>Everything you need for election night: From the Politics Desk</title><updateDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 21:30:00 GMT</updateDate></item><item><dc:creator>Scott Wong</dc:creator><dc:contributor>Ben Kamisar</dc:contributor><dateTimeWritten>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 20:45:40 GMT</dateTimeWritten><description>A handful of House Republican incumbents were caught up in tough races in districts President Donald Trump carried in 2024 — an encouraging sign for Democrats as they fight to retake the majority from the GOP.</description><expires>2112-01-01T00:00:00.000+0000</expires><guid>https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/2026-election/democrats-republicans-battle-for-house-trump-washington-midterm-rcna605760</guid><link>https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/2026-election/democrats-republicans-battle-for-house-trump-washington-midterm-rcna605760</link><media:content url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-10/261030-congress-results-mainbar-jg-3462a8.jpg" type="image/jpeg" medium="image" height="1600" width="2400"><media:credit>Justine Goode</media:credit><media:text type="plain"></media:text><media:description type="plain"></media:description></media:content><media:thumbnail url="https://media-cldnry.s-nbcnews.com/image/upload/t_fit_1500w/rockcms/2026-10/261030-congress-results-mainbar-jg-3462a8.jpg" height="1600" width="2400"></media:thumbnail><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 20:45:40 GMT</pubDate><title>Democrats have polling and history on their side in House races</title><updateDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 00:46:22 GMT</updateDate></item></channel></rss>